{# The terminology of recorded opens and clicks (specification, message_tracking.terminology), behind ⓘ next to the figures. #}
{% import 'dashboard/_macros.html.twig' as ui %}{{ ui.tip('About recorded opens and clicks: a recorded open only means the tracking image was requested; it does not prove that a person read the message. Image blocking, privacy proxies, prefetching, security scanners and caching all make opens incomplete or inflated. A recorded click means the tracked link was requested, which can also be done by link scanners. Clicks are never counted as opens.', 'About recorded opens and clicks') }}
